{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026RLnT5aALRJ1792990190.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>博愛醫院研究顯示，利用針灸可減輕耳鳴，紓緩對生活的困擾。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.EAR-1130_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Z1ec9MfHmf1792990187.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>博愛醫院在2022年12月至2024年4月，分別於元朗、沙田等中醫診所，招募90名由50至70歲、受耳鳴困擾的患者，之後提供五星期、共十次針灸治療，包括在耳周的聽宮、百會、印堂等穴位，透過電針或電溫針治療。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.EAR-1130_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026fe0tNstFg21792990284.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>研究發現完成治療後，四成六患者耳鳴響度顯著降低；五成半人受耳鳴影響的生活、心理有改善，嚴重程度由「中度」改善至輕度；無接受針灸的患者就有惡化跡象。研究結果已在國際學術期刊《醫學補充療法》發表。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:20:40.298540+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":229,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T04:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T02:11:29.227636+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T10:18:14.282240+00:00","content_hash":"73122cb68679c7fd1d28afe0e2163511e7a6d6b33a88b2e9c97ef091344203cc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:20:40.298540+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}